    "text": "Oil down, but energy markets remain far from normal. Brent has slumped 18% this month as Middle East supply recovers, yet diesel and LNG remain tight.\n\nMeanwhile, energy futures have delivered exceptional YTD returns, helped by backwardation. The market is learning to live with \"no war, no peace\", but the risk of renewed escalation remains.\n\n#Oil #Energy #Commodities https://t.co/5O4vRYA64W via @saxobank",
